[0.201,"o","\r\n"]
[0.201,"o","1. The agent tries to delete a workspace file\r\n"]
[0.201,"o","   tool call   Bash: rm notes.txt\r\n"]
[0.227,"o","   identity    agent:demo:demo-agent (signed card, verified by the gate)\r\n"]
[0.227,"o","   gate        review   external_action_review_required\r\n"]
[0.227,"o","   hook answer ask   the host stops and asks the operator\r\n"]
[0.227,"o","   executed    no   notes.txt is still there: yes\r\n"]
[0.227,"o","   receipt     xact_adm_37512fec41812ebd29739d2086ddc99a (admission receipt, persisted: true)\r\n"]
[0.228,"o","\r\n"]
[0.228,"o","2. The operator decides\r\n"]
[0.228,"o","   authority   demo authority (in-process key, no OS boundary)\r\n"]
[0.23,"o","   wrong code  963512 -> refused (TOTP_INVALID)\r\n"]
[0.23,"o","   code        963511   (the demo prints the phone screen; the otpauth URI below is a real one)\r\n"]
[0.23,"o","   otpauth     otpauth://totp/HUQAN%20demo%3Ademo-operator?secret=JGAPEU47GSG6NYH7OOXJ7EAJKBV3HY4J&issuer=HUQAN%20demo&algorithm=SHA1&digits=6&period=30\r\n"]
[0.231,"o","   decision    approved\r\n"]
[0.231,"o","   authorized  yes\r\n"]
[0.231,"o","\r\n"]
[0.231,"o","3. Only an authorized decision lets the delete run\r\n"]
[0.238,"o","   gate        review   external_action_review_required   (a delete never becomes an automatic allow)\r\n"]
[0.244,"o","   executed    yes   notes.txt is still there: no\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","4. The Trust Receipt\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   receipt     trust-receipt:67f067edd74e043f65dd1ea3a78ff50e93f2fdfccb4d5527ffe9a07e388851b1\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   hash        876850830fc3de7526b98df94a1e354267245b13eb57174fb925da4723d3474a\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   chain       intact from genesis to the tip (found)\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   seal        signed, signature valid (key ed25519:5e22f364afa1b4e6f58a71a0ce21898f)\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   verifier    the same code path `huqan receipt verify` runs (readReceiptById)\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","5. Why the demo cannot authorize production\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   runtime guard   DEMO_AUTHORITY_REFUSED\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   same-user guard DEMO_AUTHORITY_REFUSED\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   A demo decision is signed by the process being demonstrated, so it proves nothing\r\n"]
[0.246,"o","   about the operator. Install an approval authority and decide there.\r\n"]
[0.249,"o","\r\n"]
[0.249,"o","demo OK: blocked, decided, executed once, receipt verified\r\n"]
[0.249,"o","workspace left at /tmp/huqan-agent-brake-E1frnW/workspace\r\n"]
